{"id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-tm-computes.md","title":"TM计算","display":"df-tm-computes — TM计算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-tm-computes","aliases":["29-df-tm-computes"],"display":"df-tm-computes — TM计算","depends_on":["[[29-df-turing-machine]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-query]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-bin-encoding]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 2.4, p.25, scan40; natural-number partial-function interface is local reconstruction","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-tm-computes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-tm-computes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-computes — TM计算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17c1d364fcf4fba1\" href=\"?note=17c1d364fcf4fba1\" title=\"29-df-query\">29-df-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 2.4, p.25, scan40; natural-number partial-function interface is local reconstruction"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{out}}\">\\(\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{out}}\\)</span> 及其配置、转移和输出由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_T:\\{0,1\\}^*\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_T:\\{0,1\\}^*\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是其停机输出部分函数。不再使用外部机器原语。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为多项式大小有界查询。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma},\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma},\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a> 对有序输入对的接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}_k:\\mathbb N^k\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{num}_k:\\mathbb N^k\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{num}_1\\)</span> 由下式固定为分隔的一元元组编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^a\">\\(1^a\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 个符号1，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_k\\)</span> 标记同一机器集合以该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 输入编码工作的副本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\operatorname{computes} I\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma}(U)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{out}_T)\\land\\operatorname{out}_T(\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma}(U))=\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}(I(U))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\operatorname{computes} I\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma}(U)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{out}_T)\\land\\operatorname{out}_T(\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma}(U))=\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}(I(U))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_k\\coloneqq\\{(T,k)\\mid T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{out}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TM}_k\\coloneqq\\{(T,k)\\mid T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{out}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}((T,k),f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{num}_k(\\bar a)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{out}_T)\\leftrightarrow\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f))\\land(\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\to\\operatorname{out}_T(\\operatorname{num}_k(\\bar a))=\\operatorname{num}_1(f(\\bar a)))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Computes}((T,k),f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{num}_k(\\bar a)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{out}_T)\\leftrightarrow\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f))\\land(\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\to\\operatorname{out}_T(\\operatorname{num}_k(\\bar a))=\\operatorname{num}_1(f(\\bar a)))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}_k(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=1}^k(1^{a_i}\\Vert\\langle0\\rangle),\\qquad\\operatorname{num}_0(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{num}_k(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=1}^k(1^{a_i}\\Vert\\langle0\\rangle),\\qquad\\operatorname{num}_0(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 2.4，印刷页25、扫描页40，定义机器计算结构查询；只在给定序编号后使用二进制编码。新增自然数部分函数的 Computes 接口为本库 Church 论题与 FO 完备性条目的必要本地接口，不冒充原书逐字定义。部分函数计算不仅要求在定义域上得到正确值，还要求在定义域外不停止；固定有效编码改变不影响可计算性。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-query","status":"resolved","id":"17c1d364fcf4fba1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{out}}$ 及其配置、转移和输出由 [[29-df-turing-machine]] 定义；$\\operatorname{out}_T:\\{0,1\\}^*\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^*$ 是其停机输出部分函数。不再使用外部机器原语。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau$ 为有限关系词汇，$<\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau$；$I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 为多项式大小有界查询。$\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma},\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}$ 采用 [[29-df-bin-encoding]] 对有序输入对的接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{out}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_T:\\{0,1\\}^*\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma},\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{num}_k:\\mathbb N^k\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{num}_1","display":false},{"tex":"1^a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display